From: githusr <143207276+githusr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:12:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: follow Android network DNS in the standalone root core

Adapt the ConnectivityManager observer, bounded socketpair protocol and retained dex cache from Asterisk4Magisk/AndroidLibClashLite pull request 2. Publish system DNS snapshots without waiting for configuration reloads, coalesce cache refreshes under the existing lock, and start the failure deadline independently of the main loop. Keep the upstream changes limited to main and system DNS hooks; the fork workflow adapter builds the embedded dex. Include IPC, cache, resolver and reload regressions.
